        "type": "p",
        "text": "Google also reads file names, alt text and the text around an image to understand it, and it can show your images in Google Images. Our guide to [Core Web Vitals for a practice website](/guides/core-web-vitals-checklist-for-a-medical-practice-website) covers the speed side in depth. This guide stays on naming, describing and publishing."
