          "Format: JPEG for photographs, PNG for graphics with sharp text or transparency, and WebP or AVIF where your platform converts them for you. Google supports all of these.",
          "Dimensions: upload an image no wider than it will display. A photo shown 800 pixels wide gains nothing from a 4,000 pixel original.",
          "File size: compress before upload. Many practices aim for well under 200 KB for an in-page photo. Treat that as a rule of thumb, not a standard.",
